This crate (`symphonia-codec-imc`) is a pure-Rust IMC (Intel Music Coder) and IAC (Indeo Audio
Coder) decoder. It is licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0, like the rest of Project
Symphonia.

IMC has no public specification. The bitstream parsing, scale factor and bit allocation
arithmetic, the Huffman, quantizer, band and masking tables (`src/tables.rs`, extracted
programmatically from `libavcodec/imcdata.h`), the IAC table derivation and the overlap-add
windowing follow FFmpeg's `libavcodec/imc.c` and `libavcodec/imcdata.h`, which are distributed under
the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later.

